{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Spyfall</strong>, a fun and fast multiplayer game where you must be smart to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game happens in a world full of people (NPCs).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own <strong>unique feel, characters</strong>, and <strong>tasks</strong> to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7e917eef3bc2276076985416128539d4.poster.avif?t=1745802616\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7e917eef3bc2276076985416128539d4.webm?t=1745802616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7e917eef3bc2276076985416128539d4.mp4?t=1745802616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players can join:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy matches like <strong>1v1, 2v2, 3v1, 5v1</strong>, or <strong>up to 8 players</strong> with <strong>up to 2 detectives</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player is the <strong>Detective</strong> who must find the spies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players are <strong>spies</strong> who pretend to be normal people and complete secret tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.poster.avif?t=1745802616\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.webm?t=1745802616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.mp4?t=1745802616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, there are <strong>two maps</strong> you can play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A busy <strong>city</strong> with roads and tall buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A western town called <strong>Silent West</strong>, with old houses/shops and dusty streets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/0cae1de0137f200a7a9037c7c1b243bd.avif?t=1745802616\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Detective must watch carefully and find the players hiding as spies.<br>The spies must act normal, finish their tasks, and not get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is different and exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the smart spy who stays hidden?<br>Or the clever Detective who catches the spies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Clue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/f98df2ca8803ff4ba325c39f6943a1a4e77bd46f.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/6ba9c307c2839193afb413d4cf330df7af83e3f2.jpg"},{"name":"Close Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/3f950d1d1db41a517fee354827d8003e3896f3a2.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Thinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/4290394a17bfc8d2fdff0691331d4aa32c562035.jpg"},{"name":"Foolproof Strategy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/d9da62b2cbbbb650413fb7b3aafa0d2e187081b1.jpg"},{"name":"First Task Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/6363629677004419848ba655fc7d26b078252950.jpg"},{"name":"Task Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/4d4a9b55b2999fdf944d53ceace32c06db5480e6.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Task","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/61d1bc25637899dfc1c3260896e0b7e382495b07.jpg"},{"name":"Target Practice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/4f3b8f2c3ac963766b1dd3e4652cd976b0155c39.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Eliminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/8254755c56e98171511699ebd6b9cb99594f8e20.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334280?t=1745802616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334280?t=1745802616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/4e490535dd84d82985ebc21a3585b96ecfd7bd18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745802616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/4e490535dd84d82985ebc21a3585b96ecfd7bd18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745802616","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3633150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\